SUMMARY:You Had to Be There: How the Toronto Godspell Ignited the Comedy Re
 volution...
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 2:30pm\, 5pm\nMartin Short\, Eugene Levy\, Gilda Radner\
 , Victor Garber\, Paul Shaffer\, and other entertainment icons got their s
 tart in a 1972 Toronto production of the musical Godspell. Featuring inter
 views with the surviving cast members\, Lin-Manuel Miranda\, Mike Myers\, 
