 ious\, moving\, and inspiring detail. Executive produced by Judd Apatow.\n
 https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-had-to-be-there-how-the-toronto-godsp
 ell-ignited-the-comedy-revolution\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://push
 pin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-had-to-be-there-how-the-toronto-go
 dspell-ignited-the-comedy-revolution
